ItemDisplay[mjw EDAM>12 EDAM<40 (MINDMG+MINDMG+MINDMG+MAXDMG+MAXDMG>57)]: %NAME%%PURPLE%BIG %CONTINUE%
ItemDisplay[mjw EDAM>37 STAT501>0]: %NAME%%PURPLE%BIG %CONTINUE%
ItemDisplay[mjw (MINDMG+MINDMG+MINDMG+MAXDMG+MAXDMG>100)]: %NAME%%PURPLE%BIG %CONTINUE%
ItemDisplay[mjw EDAM>45 IAS>0]: %NAME%%PURPLE%BIG %CONTINUE%
ItemDisplay[mjw RES>9 IAS>0]: %NAME%%PURPLE%BIG %CONTINUE%
