// New unique bases
ItemDisplay[(smer OR uts OR uuc OR utbe) UNI !ID]: %MAP-4A%%BORDER-9B%%GOLD%*** %NAME% ***{%NAME%}
// Hatred Orbs
ItemDisplay[(hor1 OR hor2 OR hor3 OR hor4 OR hor5 OR hor6)]: %MAP-4A%%BORDER-68%%RED%*%PURPLE%*%ORANGE% Hatred Orb: %NAME% %ORANGE%*%PURPLE%*%RED%*{%NAME%}
// New SoE currency and materials
// Chaos Orb
